  "description": "The emotion of disgust is expressed through the meme's text, which humorously suggests the skunk is so offensive that it requires legal protection from public hatred. The skunk's natural odor, a source of biological disgust, is the basis for this emotional expression. The text implies that the skunk's very existence evokes strong negative feelings in humans, which is the core of the disgust emotion being conveyed.",
